WEBVTT

00:04:28.945 --> 00:04:31.920
Da li bi bilo u redu da vam odsviram
pesmu o strahu od scene?

00:04:31.920 --> 00:04:36.662
(Aplauz)

00:04:40.753 --> 00:04:43.715
Mogu li da uzmem gutljaj vode?

00:04:43.715 --> 00:04:47.666
(Muzika)

00:04:48.143 --> 00:04:50.520
Hvala.

00:04:55.442 --> 00:04:58.363
♫ Ne šalim se, znate, ♫

00:04:58.363 --> 00:05:03.991
♫ ovaj strah od scene je stvaran. ♫